  {"clause_id": "c060", "issues": [
    {"issue": "\"Timely notice of intent to core, test or log\" sets no number of hours or days and is measured only by the purpose that Farmor's representative \"may be present to witness same.\" Whether short notice was timely is left entirely at large.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.21}
